  "description": "⭐ <em>Don't just watch the film. </em><strong><em>Taste it. </em></strong><em>A bespoke cinematic dining experience where iconic film moments come straight to your table as they appear on screen, course by delicious course</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎥&nbsp;Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Snatch (2000)<br>\r\n🍺 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments<br>\r\n🍴 Expect bold, comforting flavours with Irish, English and Turkish twists, from nostalgic chippy favourites to rich guinness-infused slow-cooked stews and warm indulgent desserts with a dangerous edge.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1be6Z3j2WkMC4Fv-9daKDJBENLvFCU8zv/view?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n📅 Date: August and September 2026<br>\r\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br>\r\n📍 Location: The Moniker, EC3M 5AD<br>\r\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/snatch-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc00mta0njk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">15</a><br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: This venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❓ Experience FAQS: Click <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nStep into the underground.<br>\r\nWelcome to a side of London you weren’t meant to see. Where the deals are dodgy, stakes are high, and nothing goes <em>quite</em> to plan.&nbsp;<br>\r\nSnatch at Taste Film throws you headfirst into a fast-talking, diamond-fuelled world of crime and cult humour, brought to life through an immersive dining experience like no other. This isn’t just dinner and a film. It’s a seat at our table.<br>\r\nAs the story unfolds, so does your menu, inspired by the film’s clash of cultures. Every dish is timed to key moments on screen, packed with clever Easter eggs and playful nods that true fans deserve.<br>\r\nThis is Taste Film at its most rebellious, unpolished and unpredictable.<br>\r\nPerfect for a mate night, an unforgettable date night, or a standout Father’s Day gift, this experience draws in a crowd that appreciates grit, nostalgia, and iconic British cinema.<br>\r\nAfter a hugely successful previous run, Snatch is back, bigger, bolder, and more immersive than ever.<br>\r\nYou don’t just watch it. You’re in on it.",
